WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
After a glance, a clock seems to pause.
The effect is called chronostasis.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers measured perceived duration
after rapid eye movements.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Related timing effects were studied
with sounds and touch.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Those experiments did not evaluate Zen12.
A product claim needs separate evidence.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Check the recording, current checkout,
research and refund terms.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free twelve-minute baseline.
Keep evidence and advertising separate.
